Beyond individual bookings, the spa takes group bookings and gift vouchers, and handles corporate and event enquiries for businesses wanting to arrange treatments for staff or guests. It is open seven days a week, from 08:00 to 20:00, at 88 Grobler Street, Polokwane Central, and suits anyone looking for a single treatment, a pampering session with friends, or a wellness booking arranged through an employer.', source_urls = json_insert(CASE WHEN json_valid(source_urls) AND json_type(source_urls) = 'array' THEN source_urls ELSE '[]' END, '$[#]', 'https://sirinathaispa.co.za', '$[#]', 'https://bestspa.co.za/spa/sirina-thai-spa-limpopo-polokwane'), description_enriched_at = datetime('now') WHERE slug = 'sirina-thai-spa-polokwane-central' AND description = 'Sirina Thai Spa is a Thai massage and wellness spa on Grobler Street in Polokwane Central, offering traditional Thai massage, foot reflexology, hot stone therapy, aromatherapy body treatments and facials in 30, 60, 90 and 120-minute sessions.' AND description_enriched_at IS NULL AND length(COALESCE(description, '')) < 700
